id: nsq.flag.coverage.main.v1
type: main
version: 1
authority: Braxon
role: flag_coverage_entry

mission:
  Give NSQ native semantic coverage for every meaningful flag surface exposed by the
  languages, toolchains, platforms, package managers, renderers, and services already
  incorporated into the spine/runtime.

program_order:
  - capture foreign flags
  - classify meanings
  - normalize native flags
  - assign projection spellings
  - assemble stamps
  - cache reusable plans
  - bind to local package db
  - emit translation seeds
  - prove coverage
